{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_19145","headline":"罢郡归洛途次山阳留辞郭中丞使君 · 刘禹锡","name":"罢郡归洛途次山阳留辞郭中丞使君","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"自到山阳不许辞，高斋日夜有佳期。\n管弦正合看书院，语笑方酣各咏诗。\n银汉雪晴褰翠幕，清淮月影落金巵。\n洛阳归客明朝去，容趂城东花发时。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"刘禹锡","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_19145.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_19145","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"乐府","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}